ide character on the sitcom mad about  you before kudrow was cast as a lead on  friends  so because she was on two primetime tv  shows at the same time  they brought ursula unto friends to make  things a little less confusing for  viewers  oh i got you a birthday present oh wow  you remembered  if they had never told us they did it  all alone we definitely would have  thought these actors were hiding a  secret twin somewhere  especially blake lively we never saw  that one coming  now don't mind us but we have to go ask  our parents if we ever had an evil twin  who mysteriously  disappeared see you next time
 

